event: thinking
data: {"id": "54b02371fa18403d-thinking-parallel_evidence-392", "run_id": "54b02371fa18403d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "fetch_runbook", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "<runbook>\n# Pod CrashLoopBackOffRuntime / 容器反复退出\n\n> Pod异常类型: CrashLoopBackOffRuntime | 典型状态: CrashLoopBackOff | 兼容分类: container_runtime\n\n## 状态识别\n- Pod 状态: `CrashLoopBackOff`\n- Last State: Terminated\n-", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789353363563, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_9a4cf3c137864e4fa3977ebf", "tool_sequence": 1, "semantic_success": true, "result": "<runbook>\n# Pod CrashLoopBackOffRuntime / 容器反复退出\n\n> Pod异常类型: CrashLoopBackOffRuntime | 典型状态: CrashLoopBackOff | 兼容分类: container_runtime\n\n## 状态识别\n- Pod 状态: `CrashLoopBackOff`\n- Last State: Terminated\n- 没有已确认的 `terminated.reason=OOMKilled`；Exit Code 137 本身仍可能属于探针或其他 SIGKILL\n\n## 典型原因\n- command/args 错误、入口进程启动失败、二进制或脚本不存在。\n- 进程 exit(0) 快速退出: 容器主进程完成后退出，Deployment/Pod restartPolicy 导致循环重启，常见于把一次性任务放进长期服务。\n- 应用启动后主动退出，日志中出现业务异常但不是配置缺失。\n- 应用写文件失败导致退出，例如 `No space left on device`、权限不足、只读文件系统。\n- 应用端口冲突，例如 `Address already in use`，需要检查容器内监听端口和 command。\n- 依赖服务不可用导致进程退出；如果进程持续运行但探针失败，应切换到 NotReadyProbeFailed。\n- livenessProbe 杀死容器造成反复重启，需要结合 Events 中 `Liveness probe failed` 和 Last State。\n- 权限问题，例如 permission denied、只读文件系统、非 root 用户无法执行。\n\n## 必查项\n1. `kubectl describe pod <pod> -n <namespace>`: 查看 Last State、Exit Code、Reason、重启次数。\n2. `kubectl logs <pod> -n <namespace> --previous --tail=200`: 查看崩溃前日志。\n3. `kubectl get pod <pod> -n <namespace> -o yaml`: 查看 command/args/image/resources。\n4. `kubectl get events -n <namespace> --field-selector involvedObject.name=<pod> --sort-by='.lastTimestamp'`: 查看 BackOff、probe failed、Killing。\n5. 如果日志指向配置缺失，应切换为 `ConfigError`。\n\n## 补证提示（结果不足时继续挖掘）\n- Exit Code 只有数值时：先用 previous logs 找崩溃原文；kubectl previous logs 为空再用 `query_pod_logs` 按 pod_uid + 崩溃时间窗查采集侧日志，两者都空才记录日志缺失。\n- 重启次数只有单点时：`execute_pod_promql` 用 range 查询 `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total`，确认是持续崩溃还是已收敛。\n- 日志给出 trace ID 或错误接口时：`query_pod_tracing` 按 trace_id/request_resource 关联故障前请求，确认是否业务流量触发。\n- 只有 Last State Reason=OOMKilled 或明确 cgroup/kernel OOM 证据才切 pod-oomkilled；Exit 137 单独保留为 SIGKILL 待分流；出现配置类报错切 pod-config-error。\n\n## Liveness 场景可观测查询示例\n以下是参数形状示例，不代表所有 CrashLoop 都必须查询这些数据。先从 Pod YAML/describe 读取真实 probe path、container 和异常时间窗，再替换占位符：\n```json\n{\"tool\":\"execute_pod_promql\",\"namespace\":\"<namespace>\",\"pod\":\"<pod>\",\"purpose\":\"验证探针失败窗口内 restartCount 是否继续增长\",\"promql\":\"kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\\\"<namespace>\\\",pod=\\\"<pod>\\\",container=\\\"<container>\\\"}\",\"query_type\":\"range\",\"window_minutes\":60,\"step\":\"30s\"}\n{\"tool\":\"query_pod_logs\",\"namespace\":\"<namespace>\",\"pod\":\"<pod>\",\"container\":\"<container>\",\"purpose\":\"查找真实健康检查路径在失败窗口内的应用响应\",\"window_minutes\":60,\"keywords\":[\"<probe-path>\"],\"keyword_mode\":\"phrase\",\"max_records\":20}\n{\"tool\":\"query_pod_tracing\",\"namespace\":\"<namespace>\",\"pod\":\"<pod>\",\"purpose\":\"验证真实健康检查路径的响应码和时延\",\"window_minutes\":60,\"request_resource\":\"<probe-path>\",\"response_codes\":[500],\"include_tempo\":true,\"max_records\":20}\n```\n`purpose` 只是说明，不会自动变成过滤条件。调用后必须检查实际 query：PromQL 工具要有顶层 `namespace`、`pod`、`purpose`；日志返回 query 的 `keywords` 应包含真实 probe path；Tracing 返回 filters 的 `request_resource/response_codes` 应与调用参数一致。参数错误或过滤未生效时只修正一次，同时继续其余维度；成功 empty 与工具失败必须分开记录。\nkubelet 探针不一定被应用日志或 Trace 采集；Logging/Tracing empty 不能反驳 Kubernetes Event。`/health` 失败与 `/work` 成功属于不同 endpoint，不得写成证据冲突。\n\n## 判定规则\n| 条件 | 结论 | 置信度 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| CrashLoopBackOff + Exit Code 非 137 + 命令/进程错误 | CrashLoopBackOffRuntime | 高 |\n| CrashLoopBackOff + Exit Code 0 且主进程很快结束 | 进程正常退出但被控制器反复拉起，工作负载类型或 command 不匹配 | 高 |\n| CrashLoopBackOff + previous logs 有业务异常后进程退出 | 应用运行时异常 | 高 |\n| CrashLoopBackOff + No space left on device | 容器/节点磁盘空间不足或日志/临时文件写满 | 高 |\n| CrashLoopBackOff + Address already in use | 容器内端口冲突或进程重复启动 | 高 |\n| CrashLoopBackOff + Liveness probe failed + Last State 被 Killing | livenessProbe 配置或健康检查异常导致重启 | 中 |\n| CrashLoopBackOff + permission denied / executable not found | 启动命令、权限或镜像内容错误 | 高 |\n| CrashLoopBackOff + Last State Reason=OOMKilled | 应切换到 OOMKilled runbook | 高 |\n| CrashLoopBackOff + Liveness probe failed + Killing + Exit Code 137 | 优先按探针触发的 SIGKILL 分析，不得单独归因 OOM | 高 |\n| CrashLoopBackOff + 配置校验失败/缺配置 | 应切换到 ConfigError runbook | 高 |\n| 容器 Running 但 READY 0/1 且无重启 | 应切换到 NotReadyProbeFailed | 高 |\n\n## 标准修复建议\n- command/args、executable、permission denied: 修正镜像内容、入口命令或文件权限后滚动重启；验证 restartCount 不再增加。\n- exitCode=0 快速退出: 如果是一次性任务，改用 Job/CronJob；如果应为常驻服务，修正主进程启动命令。\n- 应用运行时异常: 根据 `kubectl logs --previous` 修复业务依赖、端口冲突、磁盘写入或权限问题；验证 previous logs 不再重复同一异常。\n- livenessProbe 杀死容器: 若应用可用但探针过严，调整 path/port/timeout/failureThreshold；若应用不可用，切换 NotReadyProbeFailed 或修复应用健康。\n- OOMKilled/配置缺失/镜像拉取失败信号明确时，切换对应 runbook，不要按普通 CrashLoop 修复。\n\n</runbook>\nNote: the above runbook is for diagnostic reference and repair planning. Follow diagnostic steps to gather current evidence using tools. Do not execute remediation commands during evidence collection. If evidence confirms a repairable branch, use the remediation guidance to propose structured remediation actions for the workflow executor.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/54b02371fa18403d-g1/tools/004-evidence-fetch_runbook.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/54b02371fa18403d-g1/tools/004-evidence-fetch_runbook.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/54b02371fa18403d-g1/tools/004-evidence-fetch_runbook.summary.txt"}

