data: {"id": "54b02371fa18403d-thinking-parallel_evidence-2050", "run_id": "54b02371fa18403d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的证据，分析如下：\n\n**实体身份与生命周期**\nPod `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r` 运行在 `node2` 上。`kubectl describe` 显示状态为 `Running`，但其生命周期状态存在矛盾：\n- **终止原因 (Last Termination)**: Exit Code 137 (SIGKILL)。\n- **探针状态**: 最近的 Liveness probe 返回 HTTP 500。\n- **事件**: 频繁触发 `Liveness probe failed` 和 `Back-off restarting failed container`。\n- **Pod UID**: `f0496f24-4504-47ae-8b6d-685bd1536991`。\n\n**支持候选原因的证据**\n1. **CrashLoopBackOff 状态确认**: `kubectl_events` 明确记录了 `Back-off restarting failed container app` 和 `Liveness pr", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 7, "ts_ms": 1789353433641, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

